The doorbell rings.
I open the door and smile.
Timo and Lena are standing at the door.
"Hello you two, come in!" I call happily.
"Hello Maya, thanks for the invitation," says Lena.
Timo holds up three bottles of beer.
"We brought cold Berlin beer," he says.
"That is perfect," I answer.
"Give me your jackets first," I say.
They take off their jackets and give them to me.
I hang them on the coat rack.
Then I point to the small dining table in my flat.
The table is already neatly set.
"Feel free to sit down already," I say.
"Afterwards I will bring the food from the kitchen," I add.
"It definitely smells great," Timo remarks.
Lena nods and puts the beer on the table.
I smile and go into the kitchen.
